## PFS Kaplan-Meier Curves {#sec-pfs-km}

::: {.panel-tabset}

### Sample-Based


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
km_data |>
  filter(fit_type == "posterior") |>
  plot_km(
    km_est_var  = sample_pfs_km_est,
    facet_col   = trial,
    obs_km_data = obs_km_data
  )
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Sample-based PFS KM (posterior) by trial. Shaded band shows 80% credible interval.](survival-analysis_files/figure-html/fig-pfs-km-sample-1.png){#fig-pfs-km-sample width=960}
:::
:::


### Superpopulation


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
km_data |>
  filter(fit_type == "posterior") |>
  plot_km(
    km_est_var  = spop_pfs_km_est,
    facet_col   = trial,
    obs_km_data = obs_km_data
  )
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Superpopulation PFS KM (posterior) by trial. Wider uncertainty than sample-based as it reflects a new patient drawn from the population.](survival-analysis_files/figure-html/fig-pfs-km-spop-1.png){#fig-pfs-km-spop width=960}
:::
:::


### Prior vs Posterior


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
km_data |>
  plot_km(
    km_est_var  = sample_pfs_km_est,
    facet_col   = trial,
    group       = fit_type,
    alpha_group = fit_type
  )
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Prior vs posterior PFS KM (sample-based) by trial.](survival-analysis_files/figure-html/fig-pfs-km-prior-post-1.png){#fig-pfs-km-prior-post width=960}
